    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4daea96ef8743cc863605c12",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "拥有超群体能的丸善斯基，\n还没出道就获得了“超跑”这个别名，\n广受各界瞩目。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8be1628b5a48b8e772588423256fef7b7a6c16990ebd0e713cb20da9a5b5573d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1004/storytimeline_501004400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11ee9c08834b05a711618d6b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她深受后辈崇拜，也有许多人视她为目标，\n这样的她把目标放在更远大的舞台上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc0063fe004f1a9d66a1d595688eab74a592cdf24549c14c5bcf165d68fc1ad4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1004/storytimeline_501004400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aeb1b90504c151572a65e6dd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "接下来，\n我与丸善斯基将一起挑战闪耀系列赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "816739f721df3ff42d25a9eb4d1b02a705197bceb2494f13a5aef6b6551048d3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1004/storytimeline_501004400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31e1051dd26b57f89a5c60ba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "丸善斯基登场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89ddf65c53f13aff273eb8d852d6b017899842565e691633a2b4e38ebdec9e7b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1004/storytimeline_501004400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dffe4a78cd1ccd19e22cc798",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“朝日杯FS”近在眼前，\n丸善斯基也抱着期待每天累积训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f26d130936aa07260774006fee2e5cbbac0da206f983b34a955e3a94bf4a8547",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1004/storytimeline_501004401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:996c5e93e3718f4715cd0fb4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "某天，追逐着丸善斯基背影的特别周与草上飞\n提出想跟她并跑练习的要求。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f79dc4830805d5604594a8081d92dfc87f339dc56e9352d90cd2bb4319cf40a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1004/storytimeline_501004401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2f9a482df440e56a229f338",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "丸善斯基感受到她们的热血……\n对“朝日杯FS”的干劲更上一层楼了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd68441c4cfb673625a1d0799d8715e005e0cea5df0e7b81bbad8958c4c1b377",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1004/storytimeline_501004401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:faa0aab17cb61e52db39c32e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "心情是最高档速",
      "source_fingerprint": "14bd307d17d1f59012d0c6aff0c6e27d3f85eea3066c2519fd085dbfcd20ed2c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1004/storytimeline_501004401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04c3a027c775bd1ef9298fdd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“皋月赏”举办前的某一天。\n她对训练员表示，跑步这件事\n不再那么令人开心了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb847d7f67e2f27417a1b5fff47d85f417be14cf1cd37f170972a9e627ecf931",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1004/storytimeline_501004402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6de8dbe5ef05e0fe8e9decdb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员让意志消沉的丸善斯基，\n看看崇拜她的后辈们努力训练的模样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cef5e6ac2191200463383fa4800d022138122f394140b864d9caeb877ab6d450",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1004/storytimeline_501004402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e27bb4635967199aede50fbb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了追过丸善斯基，特别周与草上飞\n看起来很开心地持续训练到很晚。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83084cadf8cc9d22fbf2cec8e2884088a1e6c597fe05205f29e9b3f08b342ce0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1004/storytimeline_501004402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3a647e10870f65f8a4c6065",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看到她们努力的身影，\n丸善斯基察觉到自己跑步的模样\n具有可以吸引许多人的力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "236bab9788098b9041a52f3504ac085abc918c57130259655b5c20b5900e080c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1004/storytimeline_501004402.json",
      "json_path": [
